{"id":"627339","name":"花椒叶鸡蛋煎饼","author":"一溪月","authorId":"10449735","desc":"*本菜谱为作者独家发布于美食天下，禁止其他平台或个人转载。","cover":"images/627339/cover.jpg","ingredients":{"main":[{"name":"花椒叶","amount":"适量"},{"name":"柴鸡蛋","amount":"一个"},{"name":"面粉","amount":"40g"}],"sub":[{"name":"盐","amount":"少许"},{"name":"花生油","amount":"适量"}]},"steps":[{"step":1,"desc":"摘了一把花椒叶。","img":"images/627339/step_1.jpg"},{"step":2,"desc":"洗净。","img":"images/627339/step_2.jpg"},{"step":3,"desc":"适量面粉。","img":"images/627339/step_3.jpg"},{"step":4,"desc":"花椒叶放上面，一点点盐","img":"images/627339/step_4.jpg"},{"step":5,"desc":"和成酸奶糊，喜欢小米椒的切几粒放进去。","img":"images/627339/step_5.jpg"},{"step":6,"desc":"打一个鸡蛋备用。","img":"images/627339/step_6.jpg"},{"step":7,"desc":"锅里适量油烧微热，面糊倒进去。","img":"images/627339/step_7.jpg"},{"step":8,"desc":"借助锅铲摊圆。中小火煎制。","img":"images/627339/step_8.jpg"},{"step":9,"desc":"待饼面面糊凝固。","img":"images/627339/step_9.jpg"},{"step":10,"desc":"倒入鸡蛋液，转圆。","img":"images/627339/step_10.jpg"},{"step":11,"desc":"煎制一会儿，饼底微微焦黄，饼面鸡蛋液凝固。","img":"images/627339/step_11.jpg"},{"step":12,"desc":"翻面。","img":"images/627339/step_12.jpg"},{"step":13,"desc":"饼面也煎至微微焦黄即可。","img":"images/627339/step_13.jpg"},{"step":14,"desc":"成品。","img":"images/627339/step_14.jpg"},{"step":15,"desc":"成品。","img":"images/627339/step_15.jpg"}],"tips":"来自 美食天下  的作品\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t使用的厨具：不粘锅\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t所属分类：","attrs":{}}